The "it's come down a lot" perception appears to stem from the ~-17% pullback
from the 52-week high (2,192,000KRW) to current (1,825,000KRW). However, this
stock surged nearly 2× from 918,000KRW just 20 days ago. The current level is
a post-surge peak correction, not a low-entry opportunity.

